Modifications: independent native Go MQTT framing, fixed-origin WebSocket
transport, bounded JSON-lines interface, cancellation, and authored offline
fixtures. No Python source is bundled or executed. This helper performs no
QR creation, device operations, final session exchange, or HTTP login calls.

